/*
Herbception error core types.

std::errc handling: the only <system_error> dependency is std::errc. On hosted
builds the real std::errc from <system_error> is used when available. On
freestanding builds <system_error> is avoided entirely (it is hosted-only in
some implementations, e.g. libstdc++'s requires_hosted.h gate) and a minimal
std::errc enum is defined locally with the same layout as every major
implementation (libstdc++, libc++, MSVC STL) so the {domain, code} ABI slot
and the do_to_errc signature are identical either way. This mirrors the "hack"
fast_io uses for errc.
*/

